  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize high-value cards (Jokers) in your melds. If you lose the hand, having a Joker in your hand is a 50-point penalty.\n\nThe Offering Phase: Offer cards that are 'dead' to the board (e.g., a card whose duplicates have already been melded or discarded). Never offer a card that helps an opponent complete a run.\n\nWild Hijacking: Keep 'natural' cards that match current wild positions in opponents' melds. Steal the wild only when you are ready to complete your own contract or go rummy.",
    Player: "Prioritize high-value cards (Jokers) in your melds. If you lose the hand, having a Joker in your hand is a 50-point penalty.\n\nThe Offering Phase: Offer cards that are 'dead' to the board (e.g., a card whose duplicates have already been melded or discarded). Never offer a card that helps an opponent complete a run.\n\nWild Hijacking: Keep 'natural' cards that match current wild positions in opponents' melds. Steal the wild only when you are ready to complete your own contract or go rummy.",
